{title: Sólo tu eres digno}
{artist: Avivamiento}
{composer: Patrcia Rodriguez}
{key: Ebm}
{source: https://www.cifraclub.com/avivamiento/solo-tu-eres-digno/}

{start_of_verse}
                         [F#]
                       Santo Santo
[C#]              [D#m]
Señor Dios todo Poderoso.
                [C#]       [B]        [C#]             [F#]
                 Al que era, al que es, y al que vendrá.
{comment: Repeat verse block (//)}
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse}
                         [F#]
                     Santo Santo
   [C#]             [D#m]
Señor Dios todo Poderoso.
                [C#]       [B]        [C#]             [F#]    [C#]
                 Al que era, al que es, y al que vendrá.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus}
                              [F#]        [C#]    [B]
